PROVENANCE OF src/z380term_rbswap.c
  z380term is the small program that draws the text console on the tablet screen.
  The red/blue colour swap (option -n to switch it off) was added on 9 Oct 2026;
  src/z380term.c.diff shows that change as it was made, before the license notice
  and the credit line were added to the file. The font table in the file is described in the file's own
  header as the koi8x16 font from the X11 cyrillic fonts, public domain; that statement
  has not been verified independently.

NOT IN THIS REPOSITORY, AND NOT TO BE ADDED
  - Dumps or backups of any partition of a tablet (they hold data that is unique to
    one device: calibration, serial numbers, keys, user data).
  - ASUS firmware, the stock boot image, preloader and lk images.
  - The built images. boot_alpine_full.bin contains ASUS's Linux kernel and a BusyBox
    binary; system_alpine.ext4 contains many Alpine packages under many licenses.
    Build them yourself with the scripts in src/.

